## Testing Requirements

### Unit Tests
- [ ] TranscriptFlow serialization round-trip
- [ ] Checkpoint loading (word-segment and TranscriptFlow)
- [ ] Edit application logic
- [ ] VAD block highlight mapping (block→turn span selection and timing edge cases)
- [ ] Database CRUD operations

### Integration Tests
- [ ] Full job submission → pipeline execution → transcript retrieval
- [ ] Edit → save → re-run → verify changes persisted
- [ ] Chunked file upload
- [ ] SSE connection and reconnection

### E2E Tests
- [ ] Complete workflow: upload → transcribe → edit → export
- [ ] Browser compatibility (Chrome, Firefox, Safari)

